	(text "USB-C port A (rev A: sink only, 5.1 kOhm Rd on CC1/CC2). CC1/CC2 also go to MCU analog inputs to read the\nsource's current advertisement (default / 1.5 A / 3 A). USBLC6-2SC6 protects D+/D- and CC1/CC2."
